          "metric_value": "",
          "unit": "",
          "source_quote": "Yes — but licensed, not open-weight. Pokee AI serves Isaac through an OpenAI-compatible developer API , and licenses it for deployment inside a VPC, on-premises, or on-device. The launch announcement advertises Day-0 support for vLLM and SGLang, and single-GPU serving starting from an RTX 4090 or equivalent. The research team publishes measurements only from a single B200-class GPU, so treat the consumer-GPU claim as vendor guidance rather than a reported result.",
